  "title": "Blueberry Crisp I",
  "description": "A very easy and delicious dessert recipe that can be used with blueberries, peaches, apples or most any other of this type fruit. After it cooks it has a beautiful crust on top.",
  "authors": [
    "Trish Ann"
  ],
